@startuml
title vive_teleop architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace

actor "Browser debug client\nindex.html\nhttp://localhost:8000" as Browser
actor "Unity VR headset\nunity-vr-headset" as Unity

node "Robot network\n10.68.0.0/24" as Net {
  node "Robot\nROS1 master\n10.68.0.1:11311" as Robot {
    component "ROS1 camera topic\n/xtion/rgb/image_raw" as Ros1Camera
    component "ROS1 joint states\n/joint_states" as Ros1JointStates
    component "ROS1 arm controller\n/arm_controller/command" as Ros1ArmCommand
    component "ROS1 head controller\n/head_controller/command" as Ros1HeadCommand
  }

  node "ros1_bridge container\n10.68.0.131" as Bridge {
    component "ros1_bridge dynamic_bridge\nNoetic -> Foxy" as DynamicBridge
  }

  node "ros2_app container\n10.68.0.132\nport 8088" as Ros2App {
    component "image_subscriber\nROS2 node" as ImageSubscriber
    component "LatestFrameVideoTrack" as VideoTrack
    component "WebRTCServer\naiohttp + aiortc" as WebRTCServer
    component "InputPublisher\nROS2 node" as InputPublisher
    queue "ROS2 topic\n/vive/head_pose" as HeadPoseTopic
    queue "ROS2 topic\n/vive/hand_target_pose" as HandTargetTopic
  }

  node "moveit_server container\n10.68.0.134" as MoveItContainer {
    component "robot_state_publisher\nTIAGo description" as RobotStatePublisher
    component "move_group\nTIAGo MoveIt config" as MoveGroup
    component "vive_moveit_server\nPython ROS2 node\nexecution_mode=ik_topic" as MoveItServer
    queue "ROS2 topic\n/joint_states" as JointStateTopic
    queue "ROS2 topic\n/head_controller/command" as HeadCommandTopic
    queue "ROS2 topic\n/arm_controller/command" as ArmCommandTopic
    interface "ROS2 service\n/compute_ik" as ComputeIkService
  }

  node "coturn container\n10.68.0.133:3478" as Coturn {
    component "TURN relay\nuser dummy/dummy" as TurnRelay
  }
}

cloud "Docker host" as Host {
  component "python3 -m http.server 8000" as StaticServer
}

Ros1Camera --> DynamicBridge : ROS1 topic
DynamicBridge --> ImageSubscriber : ROS2 /xtion/rgb/image_raw
Ros1JointStates --> DynamicBridge : ROS1 topic
DynamicBridge --> JointStateTopic : ROS2 sensor_msgs/JointState
ArmCommandTopic --> DynamicBridge : ROS2 trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory
DynamicBridge --> Ros1ArmCommand : ROS1 trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory
HeadCommandTopic --> DynamicBridge : ROS2 trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory
DynamicBridge --> Ros1HeadCommand : ROS1 trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory

ImageSubscriber --> VideoTrack : latest BGR frame
VideoTrack --> WebRTCServer : media track
WebRTCServer --> InputPublisher : data-channel JSON messages
InputPublisher --> HeadPoseTopic : geometry_msgs/PoseStamped
InputPublisher --> HandTargetTopic : geometry_msgs/PoseStamped
HeadPoseTopic --> MoveItServer : raw HMD PoseStamped
HandTargetTopic --> MoveItServer : wrist pose target
JointStateTopic --> MoveItServer : IK seed state
RobotStatePublisher --> MoveGroup : robot_description + TF
MoveGroup -- ComputeIkService : provides
MoveItServer --> ComputeIkService : moveit_msgs/GetPositionIK\narm group, arm_tool_link
MoveItServer --> HeadCommandTopic : head_pan_joint + head_tilt_joint\n20 Hz, deadband, 90% limits
MoveItServer --> ArmCommandTopic : short JointTrajectory commands\nwarmup + joint delta clamp

StaticServer --> Browser : serves index.html
Browser --> WebRTCServer : HTTP POST /offer\nSDP offer/answer
Browser --> WebRTCServer : HTTP POST /input_offer\nSDP offer/answer
Browser --> WebRTCServer : input data channel\n10 Hz unity_teleop_pose
Browser .. TurnRelay : ICE relay candidates

Unity --> WebRTCServer : WebRTC video + 6-DoF input
Unity .. TurnRelay : ICE relay candidates

note right of WebRTCServer
  Runtime entrypoint:
  ros2 run image_listener image_subscriber

  image_subscriber delegates to teleop_webrtc,
  which wires WebRTCServer to the ROS nodes.
end note

note right of MoveItServer
  Default teleop path:
  - HMD yaw/pitch -> head pan/tilt
  - publishes /head_controller/command
  - arm-only MoveIt group
  - torso_lift_joint locked out
  - seeded /compute_ik from /joint_states
  - publishes /arm_controller/command
  - retries -31 with last reachable orientation
end note

note bottom of Net
  Runtime network: docker compose field_net
  driver: ipvlan, mode: l2
end note

@enduml
